{"slug":"count-pattern-occurrences","title":"Count the Occurrences of a Pattern","topic":"arrays-strings","difficulty":"easy","order":126,"tags":["strings","substring","brute-force"],"timeLimitMs":2000,"concept":{"title":"Try every starting position","body":["To find where a pattern `p` occurs in a text `s`, try every starting position `i` from `0` to `len(s) - len(p)` and compare the next `len(p)` letters. Occurrences may **overlap**: in `aaaa` the pattern `aa` starts at positions 0, 1 and 2.",{"code":"count = 0\nfor i in range(len(s) - len(p) + 1):\n    if s[i:i + len(p)] == p:\n        count += 1"},"Since the loop goes through every start, overlapping matches are counted automatically. Faster algorithms exist (you will meet some later), but this one is simple and enough for short texts."]},"statement":["Count how many times the word `p` occurs in the text `s`. Occurrences may overlap."],"inputFormat":["The first line has the text `s`.","The second line has the pattern `p`."],"outputFormat":["Print the number of occurrences."],"constraints":["1 <= length of s <= 3000","1 <= length of p <= 100","Both contain lowercase letters."],"examples":[{"input":"aaaa\naa\n","output":"3\n","note":"It starts at positions 0, 1 and 2."}],"hints":["A match can start at any position from 0 to `len(s) - len(p)`.","Compare the block of `len(p)` letters starting at `i` with `p`.","Do not skip ahead after a match; overlapping matches count."],"starter":{"python":"s = input().strip()\np = input().strip()\n\n# Your code here\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    string s;\n    cin >> s;\n    string p;\n    cin >> p;\n\n    // Your code here\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        String s = sc.next();\n        String p = sc.next();\n\n        // Your code here\n    }\n}\n"},"solution":{"explanation":["Check the block of the pattern length at every start position and count the equal ones."],"complexity":"Time O(|s| * |p|), space O(1).","code":{"python":"s = input().strip()\np = input().strip()\n\ncount = 0\nfor i in range(len(s) - len(p) + 1):\n    if s[i:i + len(p)] == p:\n        count += 1\nprint(count)\n","cpp":"#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    string s;\n    cin >> s;\n    string p;\n    cin >> p;\n\n    int count = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i + (int) p.size() <= (int) s.size(); i++) {\n        if (s.compare(i, p.size(), p) == 0) count++;\n    }\n    cout << count << \"\\n\";\n\n    return 0;\n}\n","java":"import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        String s = sc.next();\n        String p = sc.next();\n\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i + p.length() <= s.length(); i++) {\n            if (s.startsWith(p, i)) count++;\n        }\n        System.out.println(count);\n    }\n}\n"}},"tests":[{"input":"aaaa\naa\n","output":"3\n"},{"input":"abc\nd\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"a\na\n","output":"1\n"},{"input":"ab\nabc\n","output":"0\n"},{"input":"abababab\naba\n","output":"3\n"},{"input":"bbaaabbbaababbababbaabbbaaaaabaaaababbababbbababbbbabaabbaba\nab\n","output":"16\n"},{"input":"\nabab\n","output":"188\n"},{"input":"\naaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\n","output":"2901\n"},{"input":"\nbb\n","output":"312\n"}]}